Package: gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal text editor with a classic menu interface
 gui is a terminal text editor with keyboard and mouse support, a menu bar,
 file selection dialogs, search and replacement, and configurable colors.
 .
 It supports UTF-8 text, up to nine open documents, two editing panels,
 selection with Shift and arrow keys, and independent undo histories.
 Copy and paste use a shared internal clipboard. Binary files can be
 inspected in a read-only hexadecimal view.
